# Workflow Execution Data Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Frontend
    participant History
    participant Matching
    participant Worker
    participant DB as Database
    
    Note over Client,DB: 1. Start Workflow
    Client->>Frontend: StartWorkflowExecution
    Frontend->>Frontend: Validate Request
    Frontend->>History: Route to Shard
    History->>History: Generate Events<br/>(WorkflowExecutionStarted,<br/>WorkflowTaskScheduled)
    History->>DB: Persist Events + Mutable State + Transfer Task
    DB-->>History: Success
    History->>Matching: AddWorkflowTask
    Matching->>Matching: Try Sync Match
    History-->>Frontend: RunID
    Frontend-->>Client: Workflow Started
    
    Note over Client,DB: 2. Worker Polls for Task
    Worker->>Matching: PollWorkflowTaskQueue (long-poll)
    Matching->>Matching: Worker waiting...
    Note over Matching: Sync Match!<br/>(< 10ms)
    Matching-->>Worker: Workflow Task
    
    Note over Client,DB: 3. Execute Workflow Code
    Worker->>Worker: Replay History
    Worker->>Worker: Execute Workflow Logic
    Worker->>Worker: Yield Commands<br/>(ScheduleActivityTask)
    Worker->>Frontend: RespondWorkflowTaskCompleted(commands)
    
    Note over Client,DB: 4. Process Commands
    Frontend->>History: Process Commands
    History->>History: Generate Events<br/>(WorkflowTaskCompleted,<br/>ActivityTaskScheduled)
    History->>DB: Persist Events + Transfer Task
    History->>Matching: AddActivityTask
    Matching->>Matching: Try Sync Match
    
    Note over Client,DB: 5. Execute Activity
    Worker->>Matching: PollActivityTaskQueue
    Matching-->>Worker: Activity Task (sync match)
    Worker->>Worker: Execute Activity<br/>(Side Effects OK!)
    Worker->>Frontend: RespondActivityTaskCompleted(result)
    Frontend->>History: Activity Completed
    History->>History: Generate Events<br/>(ActivityTaskCompleted)
    History->>DB: Persist Events
    History->>Matching: AddWorkflowTask (react to completion)
    
    Note over Client,DB: 6. Complete Workflow
    Worker->>Matching: PollWorkflowTaskQueue
    Matching-->>Worker: Workflow Task
    Worker->>Worker: Process Activity Result
    Worker->>Worker: Workflow Returns
    Worker->>Frontend: RespondWorkflowTaskCompleted<br/>(CompleteWorkflowExecution)
    Frontend->>History: Complete Workflow
    History->>History: Generate Event<br/>(WorkflowExecutionCompleted)
    History->>DB: Persist Final Events
    History-->>Frontend: Success
```
